### Тест 1: тауар жасау -> 201 Created
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Headphones Z",
  "description": "Сымсыз құлаққап",
  "price": 45000,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "supplierIds": [1]
}

### Тест 2: барлық тауар -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### Тест 3: бар тауар -> 200 OK
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### Тест 4: жоқ тауар -> 404 Not Found
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/999

### Тест 5: қате деректер -> 400 Bad Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -100
}

### Нөлдік баға -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Zero", "price": 0, "categoryId": 1 }

### Жоқ санат -> 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "NoCat", "price": 100, "categoryId": 999 }

### Жаңарту (PUT) -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Phone X (updated)", "description": "Жаңартылды", "price": 240000, "categoryId": 1, "supplierIds": [1, 2] }

### Жою -> 204 No Content
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/2

### Іздеу
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search?name=phone

### Пагинация + сұрыптау
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?page=0&size=2&sort=price,desc

### Сүзгі (баға аралығы + санат)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products?minPrice=100000&maxPrice=700000&categoryId=1

### Санаттар / жеткізушілер
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers
